# totoronext-avalonia
===
 This is a spiritual successor of Totoro, one of the issue with Totoro was it was windows only, this project attempts to solve this problem by using Avalonia as a ui framework. this allows me to target windows, linux and macOS with a single codebase. and potentially android and ios in the future.
